  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-040 (Phase 3 — engine / Network (`HFRNetwork`) — transport, endpoints, sessions, raw fetchers): Transport: protocol + URLSession + mock, form encoding (fixes accent bug), charset decoding, timeouts, typed errors incl. HTTP status.\n\n### Scope\n\nTransport: protocol + URLSession + mock, form encoding (fixes accent bug), charset decoding, timeouts, typed errors incl. HTTP status\n\n- Module: HFRNetwork · Difficulty: easy · Priority: — · ✱ fixtures-free\n- Audit source: NET-01, NET-14\n\n### Depends on\n\n—\n\n### Model\n\nSonnet → Opus\n\n### Spec\n\n- [docs/lots/LOT-040-transport.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-040-transport.md)\n\n### PRs\n\n- [francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#20](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/pull/20) — LOT-040: HFRNetwork transport (merged; work)\n- [francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#16](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/pull/16) — Claim wave 1: LOT-010 (#43)–013 (C1) and LOT-040 (C2) (merged; related)\n\n### Owner / session\n\nHistorical owner: cloud/c2-sonnet (2026-10-25)\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `done`.\n",
